    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.38,
      "text": "Okay, let's dive right into context and AI predictions."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.02,
      "end": 8.5,
      "text": "Think about peanut butter and, and salt and, the context setup."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.74,
      "end": 10.2,
      "text": "Now both end with and."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.1,
      "end": 13.98,
      "text": "But its updated vector reflects different words before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 17.68,
      "text": "Right, so using patterns learned during training,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.7,
      "end": 20.06,
      "text": "AI probability predictions."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.64,
      "end": 22.4,
      "text": "An AI would likely give"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 26.1,
      "text": "jelly a high probability after peanut butter and,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.1,
      "end": 29.02,
      "text": "and pepper a high probability after salt and."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.12,
      "end": 33.98,
      "text": "At the end of the day, the prediction depends on the context reflected in those numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.56,
      "end": 39.78,
      "text": "Kind of makes you wonder what other hidden contexts are shaping the AI we rely on every single day, doesn't it?"
    }
